								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Embark on a Culinary Adventure into the Abyss!</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/5ad36cd93828e769b4a490bb2822c04b.poster.avif?t=1793693298" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/5ad36cd93828e769b4a490bb2822c04b.webm?t=1793693298" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/5ad36cd93828e769b4a490bb2822c04b.mp4?t=1793693298" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dive into a thrilling survival roguelike where cooking monsters is the key to survival. In this unique dungeon-crawling experience, you must satisfy your hunger by turning defeated monsters into life-saving meals as you journey toward the deepest floor of a perilous, randomly generated dungeon.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.poster.avif?t=1793693298" width=720 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.webm?t=1793693298" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/2acea1e3555ca04b0bd46801d9beb090.mp4?t=1793693298" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Each floor presents new dangers, treasures, and challenges. The dungeon's procedurally generated design ensures no two playthroughs are ever the same. Adapt your strategy to unpredictable layouts, enemies, and surprises as you delve deeper into the unknown.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.poster.avif?t=1793693298" width=720 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.webm?t=1793693298" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/686872bdc1d0301e88833e593bbf0906.mp4?t=1793693298" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Customize your playstyle with over 200 types of equipment, from powerful weapons to rare artifacts that enhance your cooking and combat abilities. Experiment with unique combinations to discover the setup that best suits your survival needs.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.poster.avif?t=1793693298" width=720 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.webm?t=1793693298" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/6aae47d62a551b36a9638d68da734517.mp4?t=1793693298" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Will you conquer the abyss, or will the dungeon claim you as its next victim? Gather your courage, sharpen your skills, and prepare for an adventure that blends survival, strategy, and culinary creativity like never before. The dungeon awaits!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=1793693298" data-big-src=https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401570/extras_big/07e1ca0d0875668ab0ceda0e22c047e9.avif?t=1793693298 width=800 height=421 /></span></p>						</div>
